# ironLog --- Local-First Implementation Plan

**Version:** 1.0\
**Date:** 10 November 2026\
**Platforms:** iOS and Android\
**Storage:** One app-managed local JSON document\
**Backend:** None

A personal workout tracker inspired by Hevy. The MVP prioritises
reliable workout logging, simple local persistence, useful workout
history, and low maintenance overhead.

The application is designed for a single user on a device. It does not
require an account, network connection, server, or cloud service. All
core functionality must work offline.

