### 2.1 Persistence choice

Use `expo-file-system` to read and write an app-managed file in the
application's private documents directory.

The app does not need broad filesystem access to manage its own private
data. User-facing import and export should use the appropriate native
document/file picker and sharing mechanisms supported by Expo.

### 2.2 No secondary source of truth

The JSON document is the source of truth for exercises, routines,
